#13 50.45 in the default answer, as if the default line was a set of arguments given to a
#13 50.45 script shell.  This means you may also use $* to repeat the whole default line,
#13 50.45 so you do not have to re-type everything to add something to the default.
#13 50.45 
#13 50.45 Every time there is a substitution, you will have to confirm.  If there is an
#13 50.45 error (e.g. an unmatched backtick), the default answer will remain unchanged
#13 50.45 and you will be prompted again.
